onId":"wu","message":"张飞拒绝吴招降，忠诚受到动摇"},{"id":35286,"turn":17,"type":"city_pacified","factionId":"wu","message":"许昌多次易手后地方势力归附，补充 2 兵并恢复 1 级城防"},{"id":35287,"turn":17,"type":"city_captured","factionId":"wu","message":"吴 攻占许昌，损失 3 兵力","payload":{"cityId":"xuchang","defenderFactionId":"shu","sourceCityId":"luoyang","targetCityId":"xuchang","troops":8}},{"id":35288,"turn":17,"type":"transfer_cancelled","factionId":"shu","message":"蜀的调兵因战场局势变化而取消"},{"id":35289,"turn":18,"type":"director_last_stand","factionId":"shu","message":"蜀触发背水一战（1/2），成都集结 4 兵，但民心动荡"},{"id":35290,"turn":18,"type":"resource_overflow","factionId":"shu","message":"蜀 库存溢出，损失 0 金、29 粮"},{"id":35291,"turn":18,"type":"administration_paid","factionId":"wu","message":"吴 支付行政成本 11 金、14 粮"},{"id":35292,"turn":18,"type":"turn_prepared","factionId":null,"message":"第 18 回合（争锋阶段）收入与维持已结算"},{"id":35293,"turn":18,"type":"decision_revealed","factionId":"shu","message":"蜀：备乃汉室宗亲，志在兴复汉室。吴虏劫我翼德，侵我疆土，今日整精锐攻江州，誓清吴寇，还我汉家山河！ 决策理由：江州为吴西线重镇，守备薄弱，我集成都精锐全力攻取，拔之可破吴西线屏障，缓解汉蜀西线威胁，推进统一大业。；密谋揭晓：无隐秘意图"},{"id":35294,"turn":18,"type":"decision_revealed","factionId":"wu","message":"吴：江东精兵西出汉中，割蜀之臂。天下大势已明，望蜀汉顺天应人。 决策理由：汉中守军仅1，我以4兵攻之必克。既得汉中则蜀中分，秦岭险阻反为我屏障，为后续两路夹击成都创造有利态势。同步招降张飞，瓦解蜀军心志。；密谋揭晓：无隐秘意图"},{"id":35295,"turn":18,"type":"character_recruited","factionId":"wu","message":"张飞接受招降，转投吴"},{"id":35296,"turn":18,"type":"city_captured","factionId":"wu","message":"吴 攻占汉中，损失 2 兵力","payload":{"cityId":"hanzhong","defenderFactionId":"shu","sourceCityId":"jiangzhou","targetCityId":"hanzhong","troops":4}},{"id":35297,"turn":18,"type":"character_captured","factionId":"wu","message":"关羽在城破后被吴俘虏"},{"id":35298,"turn":18,"type":"city_captured","factionId":"shu","message":"蜀 攻占江州，损失 1 兵力","payload":{"cityId":"jiangzhou","defenderFactionId":"wu","sourceCityId":"chengdu","targetCityId":"jiangzhou","troops":4}},{"id":35299,"turn":19,"type":"administration_paid","factionId":"shu","message":"蜀 支付行政成本 2 金、2 粮"},{"id":35300,"turn":19,"type":"resource_overflow",